{"id":19,"date":"2022-11-21T12:15:02","date_gmt":"2022-11-21T12:15:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/?post_type=projects&#038;p=19"},"modified":"2025-06-03T06:51:39","modified_gmt":"2025-06-03T06:51:39","slug":"upwey-and-tecoma-community-recreation-and-sports-hub-utcrash-pavilion","status":"publish","type":"projects","link":"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/project\/upwey-and-tecoma-community-recreation-and-sports-hub-utcrash-pavilion\/","title":{"rendered":"Upwey and Tecoma Community Recreation and Sports Hub (UTCRASH) Pavilion"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate project-info\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div class=\"grid__details\"\">\n\n                \n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Location<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Upwey, Victoria<\/span><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Client name<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yarra Ranges Council<\/span><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Value<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">$4.5 M<\/span><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Timeframe<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2014-2017<\/span><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Contractor name<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/circon.com.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Circon Constructions<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Consultant name<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Structural &amp; Civil Engineer &#8211; Keith Long &amp; Associates<br \/>\n<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services Engineering &#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/www.brt.com.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BRT Consulting Engineers<\/a><br \/>\n<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Quantity Surveyor &#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/www.plancost.com.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Plancost Australia<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Photography<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Provided by Circon Construction<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                \n                \n                \n                                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__text\">\n                <p>Located in the foothills of the Dandenong Ranges, this two storey community recreation and sports hub is the legacy of a highly engaged and committed local community.<\/p>\n<p>Driven by a supportive council and made possible by state government funding, the hub is designed to be home to a coalition of local community groups. Facilities including change rooms, meeting rooms and social spaces are brought together under one roof for use by groups including local cricket, football and netball clubs, the University of the Third Age and a chess club.<\/p>\n<p>We undertook thorough consultation with the Upwey Tecoma Football &amp; Netball Club and the Upwey Tecoma Cricket Club and other end users during the design process. The design of the UTCRASH achieves maximum value for money optimising player and spectator amenity and providing high levels of flexibility to accommodate the diverse needs of these diverse community groups.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-columns-image\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div class=\"grid__image\">\n               <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"620\" height=\"821\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9318-1-6.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9318-1-6.jpg 620w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9318-1-6-227x300.jpg 227w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/>                           <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__image\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"619\" height=\"821\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9483-1-6.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9483-1-6.jpg 619w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9483-1-6-226x300.jpg 226w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 619px) 100vw, 619px\" \/>                        <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"879\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-9.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-9.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-9-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-9-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-9-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate block-quote\">\n        <div class=\"max-sm:w-full ml-auto w-1\/2\">\n            <div>\n                <blockquote>\n\n                <p>\u201cUTCRASH exemplifies our decades of experience with designing municipal sports and recreation facilities, highlighting our expertise and specialist knowledge of this building type and the needs of the people that use and visit them.<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span>\u201d<\/p>\n\n                \n                <\/blockquote>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-thirds-image\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div>\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"853\" height=\"569\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9574-1-9.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9574-1-9.jpg 853w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9574-1-9-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9574-1-9-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 853px) 100vw, 853px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-columns-text-image\">\n        \n        \n                \n        <div class=\"grid mt-[30px] md:mt-[50px]\">\n            <div class=\"grid__text space-y-12\">\n                <div><p>A new car park surrounding the facility was also developed in consultation with the adjoining Upwey High School to ensure existing bus movements and school day traffic flows could be maintained.<\/p>\n<p>We carefully negotiated authority approvals with our design solution overcoming significant complexities including the site\u2019s location on a flood plain and the building\u2019s position above an easement for a stormwater main drain.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__image\">\n                             <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"880\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-9.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-9.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-9-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-9-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-9-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate project-carousel\">\n\n        <div class=\"swiper swiper-block\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                    \n                                        \n                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"962\" height=\"641\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9325-1-3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9325-1-3.jpg 962w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9325-1-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9325-1-3-768x512.jpg 768w\" 